<title>UK: EMI falls after BZW cuts profit forecast.</title>
<headline>EMI falls after BZW cuts profit forecast.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in EMI Group dropped by more than three percent after BZW reduced its profit forecast, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 0953 GMT, the shares were down 41p to 1312-1/2p.</p>
<p>The brokerage declined to comment on the downgrade.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
